silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_08_sections_01_concrete_anchor_4#growthactionmonoidwithzero silm:hasLongDescription "The GrowthActionMonoidWithZero is the action category extended with absorbing bot. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Growth_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
